        {
          "text": " Eki n'ekigambo eki nabi Yeremia yaaragiire Seraaya mwene Neria, mwijukuru wa Maaseya, obu yaatwarwa Babulooni na Zedekia omugabe wa Yuda omu mwaka gwa kana ogw'omu butegyeki bwe. Seraaya ogwo akaba ari omukuru w'amabiikiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
