        {
          "text": " Yeremia yaahandiika omu kitabo akabi koona akrihika ahari Babulooni, ebyo bigambo byona ebyahandiikirwe nbigamba ahari Babulooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia yaagira Seraaya ati: Ku oraahikye Babulooni, otabura kushoma ebyo bigambo byona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ogire oti: Ai bambe MUKAMA, ogambire akabi aha mwanya ogu kuguherekyereza, ngu hatagira owaagutuuramu, yaaba bantu nari amatungo, kureka gube amatongo ebiro byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.62"
            ]
          }
        },
